text_01E6:
    string "Don't think you've won with this,%Knyo!"  ; ja: これで勝ったと思うなにょーー！

text_0205:
    string "I can still keep trying, nyo"  ; ja: ボクちんはまだガンバれるにょー

text_0224:
    string "My kingdom will last forever%Kand ever, nyo!!"  ; ja: 我が王国は永遠に不滅にょーーー！！

text_0247:
    string "Did you see, nyo! This is the%KSuper Sorcery Merge, nyo!!"  ; ja: 見たかにょ！%Kこれぞ超魔導合体にょーー！！

text_0272:
    string "This is the might of magical%Kpower, nyo"  ; ja: これぞマジカルパワーの威力だにょー

text_0295:
    string "The absolutely invincible store is%Kcomplete, nyo"  ; ja: 絶対無敵店の完成にょー

text_02AC:
    string "This is the Sorcery Merge, nyo!"  ; ja: これぞ魔導合体にょ！

text_02C1:
    string "Merging with magical power, nyo"  ; ja: マジカルパワーで合体だにょ

text_02DC:
    string "The plan is going smoothly, nyo"  ; ja: 作戦は順調なのだにょ

text_02F1:
    string "Peace is best, nyo"           ; ja: 平和が１番だにょ

text_0302:
    string "Peace is important, nyo"      ; ja: 平和が大切だにょ

text_0313:
    string "Is this a rest area, nyo?"    ; ja: ここは休憩所なのかにょ？

text_032C:
    string "Was that a good deal, nyo?"     ; ja: お得だったのかにょ？

text_0341:
    string "Sales are nice, nyo ♪"        ; ja: セールっていいにょ♪

text_0356:
    string "The plan worked, nyo"         ; ja: 作戦成功だにょ

text_0365:
    string "I'm overcome by homesickness, nyo"  ; ja: 望郷の念にかられるにょ

text_037C:
    string "Time to rethink my strategy, nyo"   ; ja: 作戦を立て直すにょ

text_038F:
    string "I'm worried about my homeland, nyo"  ; ja: 我が祖国が心配だにょ

text_03A4:
    string "Should I have used it, nyo?"  ; ja: 使ってもよかったにょ？

text_03BB:
    string "The elevator is cursed, nyo!"  ; ja: エレベーターは呪われているにょ！

text_03DC:
    string "This is part of the plan too,%Knyo"  ; ja: これも戦略のうちだにょ

text_03F3:
    string "Sleepy, nyo"                  ; ja: 眠いにょ

text_03FC:
    string "I'll rethink the plan, nyo"    ; ja: 作戦を練り直すにょ

text_040F:
    string "I'll take a short rest, nyo"  ; ja: 一休みするにょ

text_041E:
    string "Is this another world, nyo?"  ; ja: ここは別世界なのかにょ？

text_0437:
    string "Is this what they call science,%Knyo?"  ; ja: これが科学というものにょ？

text_0452:
    string "Flying by magic is faster, nyo"  ; ja: 魔法で飛んだほうが速いにょ

text_046D:
    string "May I cast a%KFire Missile, nyo?"  ; ja: ファイヤーミサイルを%K唱えてもいいかにょ？

text_0498:
    string "May I fire a%KLightning Bolt, nyo?"  ; ja: ライトニングボルトを%K撃ってもいいかにょ？

text_04C3:
    string "The plan failed, nyo"         ; ja: 作戦失敗だにょ

text_04D2:
    string "Looks like the curse is taking%Keffect, nyo"  ; ja: ノロイの効果が効いてきたようだにょ

text_04F5:
    string "Looks like the magic is taking%Keffect, nyo"  ; ja: マホウの効果がでてきたようだにょ

text_0516:
    string "Power explosion, nyo"         ; ja: パワーさくれつにょ

text_0529:
    string "Nyo?"                         ; ja: にょ？

text_0530:
    string "The money's fine, nyo"        ; ja: お金は大丈夫にょ

text_0541:
    string "I can't control my power, nyo"  ; ja: 力の制御が効かないにょ

text_0558:
    string "My kingdom's national power%Kwent up, nyo"  ; ja: 我が王国の国力がアップしたにょ

text_0577:
    string "Ready to intercept, nyo"      ; ja: 迎撃準備完了だにょ

text_058A:
    string "Sorry for getting in the way, nyo"  ; ja: ジャマしてゴメンにょ

text_059F:
    string "This is the work of a dark%Ksorcerer, nyo"  ; ja: これは魔導公国の策略だにょー

text_05BC:
    string "Can't magic do something, nyo?"  ; ja: 魔法で何とかならないにょ？

text_05D7:
    string "Why am I so unlucky, nyo"     ; ja: なんでこんなに不幸なにょ

text_05F0:
    string "One step closer to founding a%Ksorcery empire, nyo"  ; ja: 魔導帝国設立に１歩前進したにょ

text_060F:
    string "One step closer to my ambition,%Knyo"  ; ja: 我が野望に１歩前進したにょ

text_062A:
    string "My magical power went up, nyo!"  ; ja: マジカルパワーがアップしたにょ！

text_064B:
    string "My kingdom's finances are tight,%Knyo..."  ; ja: 我が王国の財政は苦しいにょ・・・

text_066C:
    string "I'll get it back right away, nyo!"  ; ja: すぐに取り返してやるにょ！

text_0687:
    string "I'm done with this store, nyo"  ; ja: このテナントは用済みだにょ

text_06A2:
    string "My kingdom's finances are in%Ka tight spot, nyo ≦"  ; ja: 我が王国の財政は厳しいにょ≦

text_06BF:
    string "Lend me money, nyo"           ; ja: お金貸して欲しいにょ

text_06D4:
    string "Oops, nyo! No money, nyo"     ; ja: しまったにょ！お金が無いにょ

text_06F1:
    string "I'll hold back for now, nyo"  ; ja: 今は我慢するにょ

text_0702:
    string "It's a strategy, nyo"         ; ja: 作戦だにょ

text_070D:
    string "I decided not to buy, nyo"    ; ja: 買うのやめたにょ

text_071E:
    string "Hmph nyo"                    ; ja: ふふ～んにょ

text_072B:
    string "Daaa, nyo"                    ; ja: だーーにょ

text_0736:
    string "I'll do my best, nyo"         ; ja: ガンバるにょ
    bytes 0x00    ; padding
